{"id":"9c709097572b96e4","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad.md","title":"Theorem — 伴随诱导单子","display":"Theorem — 伴随诱导单子","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad","aliases":["14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad"],"display":"Theorem — 伴随诱导单子","source_ref":"IV.4, p.177","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-df-monad]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 伴随诱导单子"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.4, p.177"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61a5bbf642ba9c20\" href=\"?note=61a5bbf642ba9c20\" title=\"14-df-monad\">14-df-monad</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> 左伴随于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span>，指定单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow GF\">\\(\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow GF\\)</span> 和余单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon:FG\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal D}\">\\(\\varepsilon:FG\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal D}\\)</span>，满足两条三角恒等式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T=G\\circ F,\\qquad\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)}),\\qquad\\mu=(T\\circ T,T,(\\mu_A)_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T=G\\circ F,\\qquad\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)}),\\qquad\\mu=(T\\circ T,T,(\\mu_A)_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsMonad}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\eta,\\mu).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsMonad}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\eta,\\mu).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 的自然性来自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 的自然性。对箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{FA}:FGFA\\to FA\">\\(\\varepsilon_{FA}:FGFA\\to FA\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 的自然性，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ FG(\\varepsilon_{FA})=\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ\\varepsilon_{FGFA}\">\\(\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ FG(\\varepsilon_{FA})=\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ\\varepsilon_{FGFA}\\)</span>；施以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 即单子结合律。两条单位律分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ F\\eta_A=1\">\\(\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ F\\eta_A=1\\)</span> 施以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ\\eta_{GFA}=1\">\\(G\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ\\eta_{GFA}=1\\)</span>。因此每条公理都可追溯到指定伴随数据。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，IV.4, p.177。此处来源定位沿用所附笔记；本次未获得所列原书文件。数学结构及必要条件以本条 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 为准。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad","status":"resolved","id":"61a5bbf642ba9c20","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monad]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta:1_{\\mathcal C}\\Rightarrow GF","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon:FG\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal D}","display":false},{"tex":"T=G\\circ F,\\qquad\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)}),\\qquad\\mu=(T\\circ T,T,(\\mu_A)_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsMonad}_{\\mathcal C}(T,\\eta,\\mu).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_{FA}:FGFA\\to FA","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ FG(\\varepsilon_{FA})=\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ\\varepsilon_{FGFA}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ F\\eta_A=1","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\varepsilon_{FA}\\circ\\eta_{GFA}=1","display":false}],"bytes":1536,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad|thm-213 — 伴随诱导单子]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-252","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]]"},{"id":"552e996c15863488","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$、$G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ 是指定单位 $\\eta$、余单位 $\\varepsilon$ 的伴随数据，满足 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]] 的两条三角式。取 [[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]] 的 $T=GF$、$\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)})$。代数范畴及自由/遗忘函子见 [[14-df-monad-algebras]]。$D,D'$ 是 $\\mathcal D$ 对象；比较函子记 $\\mathsf K$，避免与代数对象的通用字母混同。单子性谓词保留所指定伴随的全部参数；范畴等价采用 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-313","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad|thm-213 — 伴随诱导单子]]"}],"outgoing":["d2b4e5cf16585f95","61a5bbf642ba9c20"]}